{"source":"https://www.shugiin.go.jp/internet/itdb_annai.nsf/html/statics/shiryo/dl-constitution.htm","articles":[{"number":9,"title":"戦争の放棄","keywords":"戦争放棄・戦力不保持","text":"日本国民は、正義と秩序を基調とする国際平和を誠実に希求し、国権の発動たる戦争と、武力による威嚇又は武力の行使は、国際紛争を解決する手段としては、永久にこれを放棄する。前項の目的を達するため、陸海空軍その他の戦力は、これを保持しない。国の交戦権は、これを認めない。","reading":"にほんこくみんは、せいぎとちつじょをきちょうとするこくさいへいわをせいじつにききゅうし、こっけんのはつどうたるせんそうと、ぶりょくによるいかくまたはぶりょくのこうしは、こくさいふんそうをかいけつするしゅだんとしては、えいきゅうにこれをほうきする。ぜんこうのもくてきをたっするため、りくかいくうぐんそのたのせんりょくは、これをほじしない。くにのこうせんけんは、これをみとめない。","segments":[{"text":"日本国民","reading":"にほんこくみん"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"正義","reading":"せいぎ"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"秩序","reading":"ちつじょ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"基調","reading":"きちょう"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"国際平和","reading":"こくさいへいわ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"誠実","reading":"せいじつ"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"希求","reading":"ききゅう"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"国権","reading":"こっけん"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"発動","reading":"はつどう"},{"text":"た","reading":"た"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"戦争","reading":"せんそう"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"武力","reading":"ぶりょく"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"よ","reading":"よ"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"威嚇又","reading":"いかくまた"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"武力","reading":"ぶりょく"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"行使","reading":"こうし"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"国際紛争","reading":"こくさいふんそう"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"解決","reading":"かいけつ"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"手段","reading":"しゅだん"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"永久","reading":"えいきゅう"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"放棄","reading":"ほうき"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"前項","reading":"ぜんこう"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"目的","reading":"もくてき"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"達","reading":"たっ"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"た","reading":"た"},{"text":"め","reading":"め"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"陸海空軍","reading":"りくかいくうぐん"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"他","reading":"た"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"戦力","reading":"せんりょく"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"保持","reading":"ほじ"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"国","reading":"くに"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"交戦権","reading":"こうせんけん"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"認","reading":"みと"},{"text":"め","reading":"め"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"}],"label":"第9条 · 戦争の放棄","note":"覚えるキーワード：戦争放棄・戦力不保持"},{"number":11,"title":"基本的人権の享有","keywords":"侵すことのできない永久の権利","text":"国民は、すべての基本的人権の享有を妨げられない。この憲法が国民に保障する基本的人権は、侵すことのできない永久の権利として、現在及び将来の国民に与へられる。","reading":"こくみんは、すべてのきほんてきじんけんのきょうゆうをさまたげられない。このけんぽうがこくみんにほしょうするきほんてきじんけんは、おかすことのできないえいきゅうのけんりとして、げんざいおよびしょうらいのこくみんにあたえられる。","segments":[{"text":"国民","reading":"こくみん"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"べ","reading":"べ"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"基本的人権","reading":"きほんてきじんけん"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"享有","reading":"きょうゆう"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"妨","reading":"さまた"},{"text":"げ","reading":"げ"},{"text":"ら","reading":"ら"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"憲法","reading":"けんぽう"},{"text":"が","reading":"が"},{"text":"国民","reading":"こくみん"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"保障","reading":"ほしょう"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"基本的人権","reading":"きほんてきじんけん"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"侵","reading":"おか"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"で","reading":"で"},{"text":"き","reading":"き"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"永久","reading":"えいきゅう"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"権利","reading":"けんり"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"現在及","reading":"げんざいおよ"},{"text":"び","reading":"び"},{"text":"将来","reading":"しょうらい"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"国民","reading":"こくみん"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"与へ","reading":"あたえ"},{"text":"ら","reading":"ら"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"}],"label":"第11条 · 基本的人権の享有","note":"覚えるキーワード：侵すことのできない永久の権利"},{"number":13,"title":"個人の尊重","keywords":"幸福追求権","text":"すべて国民は、個人として尊重される。生命、自由及び幸福追求に対する国民の権利については、公共の福祉に反しない限り、立法その他の国政の上で、最大の尊重を必要とする。","reading":"すべてこくみんは、こじんとしてそんちょうされる。せいめい、じゆうおよびこうふくついきゅうにたいするこくみんのけんりについては、こうきょうのふくしにはんしないかぎり、りっぽうそのたのこくせいのうえで、さいだいのそんちょうをひつようとする。","segments":[{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"べ","reading":"べ"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"国民","reading":"こくみん"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"個人","reading":"こじん"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"尊重","reading":"そんちょう"},{"text":"さ","reading":"さ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"生命","reading":"せいめい"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"自由及","reading":"じゆうおよ"},{"text":"び","reading":"び"},{"text":"幸福追求","reading":"こうふくついきゅう"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"対","reading":"たい"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"国民","reading":"こくみん"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"権利","reading":"けんり"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"つ","reading":"つ"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"公共","reading":"こうきょう"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"福祉","reading":"ふくし"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"反","reading":"はん"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"限","reading":"かぎ"},{"text":"り","reading":"り"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"立法","reading":"りっぽう"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"他","reading":"た"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"国政","reading":"こくせい"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"上","reading":"うえ"},{"text":"で","reading":"で"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"最大","reading":"さいだい"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"尊重","reading":"そんちょう"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"必要","reading":"ひつよう"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"}],"label":"第13条 · 個人の尊重","note":"覚えるキーワード：幸福追求権"},{"number":14,"title":"法の下の平等","keywords":"差別の禁止","text":"すべて国民は、法の下に平等であつて、人種、信条、性別、社会的身分又は門地により、政治的、経済的又は社会的関係において、差別されない。華族その他の貴族の制度は、これを認めない。栄誉、勲章その他の栄典の授与は、いかなる特権も伴はない。栄典の授与は、現にこれを有し、又は将来これを受ける者の一代に限り、その効力を有する。","reading":"すべてこくみんは、ほうのもとにびょうどうであって、じんしゅ、しんじょう、せいべつ、しゃかいてきみぶんまたはもんちにより、せいじてき、けいざいてきまたはしゃかいてきかんけいにおいて、さべつされない。かぞくそのたのきぞくのせいどは、これをみとめない。えいよ、くんしょうそのたのえいてんのじゅよは、いかなるとっけんもともなわない。えいてんのじゅよは、げんにこれをゆうし、またはしょうらいこれをうけるもののいちだいにかぎり、そのこうりょくをゆうする。","segments":[{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"べ","reading":"べ"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"国民","reading":"こくみん"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"法","reading":"ほう"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"下","reading":"もと"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"平等","reading":"びょうどう"},{"text":"で","reading":"で"},{"text":"あつ","reading":"あっ"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"人種","reading":"じんしゅ"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"信条","reading":"しんじょう"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"性別","reading":"せいべつ"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"社会的身分又","reading":"しゃかいてきみぶんまた"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"門地","reading":"もんち"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"よ","reading":"よ"},{"text":"り","reading":"り"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"政治的","reading":"せいじてき"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"経済的又","reading":"けいざいてきまた"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"社会的関係","reading":"しゃかいてきかんけい"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"お","reading":"お"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"差別","reading":"さべつ"},{"text":"さ","reading":"さ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"華族","reading":"かぞく"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"他","reading":"た"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"貴族","reading":"きぞく"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"制度","reading":"せいど"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"認","reading":"みと"},{"text":"め","reading":"め"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"栄誉","reading":"えいよ"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"勲章","reading":"くんしょう"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"他","reading":"た"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"栄典","reading":"えいてん"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"授与","reading":"じゅよ"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"か","reading":"か"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"特権","reading":"とっけん"},{"text":"も","reading":"も"},{"text":"伴は","reading":"ともなわ"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"栄典","reading":"えいてん"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"授与","reading":"じゅよ"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"現","reading":"げん"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"有","reading":"ゆう"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"又","reading":"また"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"将来","reading":"しょうらい"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"受","reading":"う"},{"text":"け","reading":"け"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"者","reading":"もの"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"一代","reading":"いちだい"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"限","reading":"かぎ"},{"text":"り","reading":"り"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"効力","reading":"こうりょく"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"有","reading":"ゆう"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"}],"label":"第14条 · 法の下の平等","note":"覚えるキーワード：差別の禁止"},{"number":19,"title":"思想・良心の自由","keywords":"内心の自由","text":"思想及び良心の自由は、これを侵してはならない。","reading":"しそうおよびりょうしんのじゆうは、これをおかしてはならない。","segments":[{"text":"思想及","reading":"しそうおよ"},{"text":"び","reading":"び"},{"text":"良心","reading":"りょうしん"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"自由","reading":"じゆう"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"侵","reading":"おか"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"ら","reading":"ら"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"}],"label":"第19条 · 思想・良心の自由","note":"覚えるキーワード：内心の自由"},{"number":20,"title":"信教の自由","keywords":"政教分離","text":"信教の自由は、何人に対してもこれを保障する。いかなる宗教団体も、国から特権を受け、又は政治上の権力を行使してはならない。何人も、宗教上の行為、祝典、儀式又は行事に参加することを強制されない。国及びその機関は、宗教教育その他いかなる宗教的活動もしてはならない。","reading":"しんきょうのじゆうは、なんぴとにたいしてもこれをほしょうする。いかなるしゅうきょうだんたいも、くにからとっけんをうけ、またはせいじじょうのけんりょくをこうししてはならない。なんぴとも、しゅうきょうじょうのこうい、しゅくてん、ぎしきまたはぎょうじにさんかすることをきょうせいされない。くにおよびそのきかんは、しゅうきょうきょういくそのたいかなるしゅうきょうてきかつどうもしてはならない。","segments":[{"text":"信教","reading":"しんきょう"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"自由","reading":"じゆう"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"何人","reading":"なんぴと"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"対","reading":"たい"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"も","reading":"も"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"保障","reading":"ほしょう"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"か","reading":"か"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"宗教団体","reading":"しゅうきょうだんたい"},{"text":"も","reading":"も"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"国","reading":"くに"},{"text":"か","reading":"か"},{"text":"ら","reading":"ら"},{"text":"特権","reading":"とっけん"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"受","reading":"う"},{"text":"け","reading":"け"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"又","reading":"また"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"政治上","reading":"せいじじょう"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"権力","reading":"けんりょく"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"行使","reading":"こうし"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"ら","reading":"ら"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"何人","reading":"なんぴと"},{"text":"も","reading":"も"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"宗教上","reading":"しゅうきょうじょう"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"行為","reading":"こうい"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"祝典","reading":"しゅくてん"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"儀式又","reading":"ぎしきまた"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"行事","reading":"ぎょうじ"},{"text":"に","reading":"に"},{"text":"参加","reading":"さんか"},{"text":"す","reading":"す"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"と","reading":"と"},{"text":"を","reading":"を"},{"text":"強制","reading":"きょうせい"},{"text":"さ","reading":"さ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"},{"text":"国及","reading":"くにおよ"},{"text":"び","reading":"び"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"機関","reading":"きかん"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"宗教教育","reading":"しゅうきょうきょういく"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"他","reading":"た"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"か","reading":"か"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"る","reading":"る"},{"text":"宗教的活動","reading":"しゅうきょうてきかつどう"},{"text":"も","reading":"も"},{"text":"し","reading":"し"},{"text":"て","reading":"て"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"ら","reading":"ら"},{"text":"な","reading":"な"},{"text":"い","reading":"い"},{"text":"。","reading":"。"}],"label":"第20条 · 信教の自由","note":"覚えるキーワード：政教分離"},{"number":21,"title":"表現の自由","keywords":"言論・出版・集会・結社","text":"集会、結社及び言論、出版その他一切の表現の自由は、これを保障する。検閲は、これをしてはならない。通信の秘密は、これを侵してはならない。","reading":"しゅうかい、けっしゃおよびげんろん、しゅっぱんそのたいっさいのひょうげんのじゆうは、これをほしょうする。けんえつは、これをしてはならない。つうしんのひみつは、これをおかしてはならない。","segments":[{"text":"集会","reading":"しゅうかい"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"結社及","reading":"けっしゃおよ"},{"text":"び","reading":"び"},{"text":"言論","reading":"げんろん"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"出版","reading":"しゅっぱん"},{"text":"そ","reading":"そ"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"他一切","reading":"たいっさい"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"表現","reading":"ひょうげん"},{"text":"の","reading":"の"},{"text":"自由","reading":"じゆう"},{"text":"は","reading":"は"},{"text":"、","reading":"、"},{"text":"こ","reading":"こ"},{"text":"れ","reading":"れ"},{"text":"を","readin